<?svml using="@hypit/markup"?>
<svml>
  <import as="copy" source="./script.svml"/>
  <import as="text" from="@hypit/text"/>
  <import as="speaker-kit" source="@hypit/seedance-kits/speaker"/>
  <import as="settings" source="../recipes/performance.svs"/>

  <text:Value id="opening-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She excitedly shares a discovery with bright, quick confidence. On “一分钟”, she lifts her free index finger beside her face with raised eyebrows and a buoyant vocal accent, then lowers it into lively hand beats during the introduction. As she says the complete project name “high pit”, her smile widens. On “开始咯！”, she keeps looking into the lens, leans slightly forward and opens her free palm toward the camera in one inviting forward push, stopping short of covering the lens. The camera stays fixed.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="opening-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Param name="composition-stability" value="soft-locked"/>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.opening.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={opening-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="introduction-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She has found something useful and cannot wait to show a friend how easy it is. Her explanation flows quickly, with a pleased, confident smile. On “只要半小时”, her eyebrows rise and the free hand gives one emphatic downward beat; “半小时” carries the surprise. On “你自己的脸和产品”, she opens her palm toward the viewer and gives “你自己的” an inviting emphasis, making the benefit feel personal.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="introduction-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.introduction.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={introduction-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="competitors-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She challenges an overpriced offer with amused disbelief, looking to the viewer to share the judgment. On “收你几十美元”, her brows rise and her free palm turns upward in a questioning gesture, with an incredulous accent on “几十美元”. Her expression tightens at “只能照着模板做”. The final “还会给你打他们家的水印哦” lands with a small disbelieving head shake and a wry, pointed smile; the complaint becomes sharper as she speaks.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="competitors-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.competitors.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={competitors-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="two-roads-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She draws the viewer closer to explain something she has figured out, with eager confidence and direct eye contact. On “那接下来”, she leans slightly toward the camera and brings her free palm forward in a quick inviting gesture. Give “我给你拆解” a purposeful, confident emphasis. She straightens while clearly articulating the complete phrase “Hypit 的底层逻辑”, then relaxes into an amused, knowing smile on “说白了”. A short sideways sweep of the open hand accompanies “两条路嘛”, which ends in an assured falling cadence. The gestures flow with the six-second explanation.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="two-roads-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.two-roads.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={two-roads-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="editor-road-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She briskly walks a friend through a familiar routine, confident that they will recognize it. Give “第一条路” a clear accented entrance. On “别看有那么多种”, her eyebrows lift with a lightly amused expression; on “但逻辑都是一样的”, she gives one knowing nod with a lightly amused smile. Her free hand moves from an open presenting gesture on “素材生成好” into two purposeful placement beats through “贴到时间轴和画布上”.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="editor-road-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.editor-road.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={editor-road-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="keyframe-cost-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. Her initial concession turns into increasingly incredulous criticism. On “虽然贴的还可以”, she gives a brief conceding nod; at “但做动效就不行咯”, her brow tightens, her head gives a short decisive shake, and her voice becomes pointed. The ordinary wishes for a number and a picture are spoken with easy expectation. On “二十几个时间点” and “几十万的token”, her eyebrows lift in disbelief and her free hand opens in exasperation. Finish “而且还改不了样式” with a firm downward vocal landing and one decisive palm-down beat. Keep the explanation quick and connected as the frustration grows.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="keyframe-cost-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.keyframe-cost.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={keyframe-cost-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="code-road-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She brightens as she introduces a genuinely exciting alternative. “第二条路” gets a fresh, clear vocal lift and a more upright posture. She names the tools with easy familiarity, then opens her free arm outward on “动效想怎么做怎么做”, with widened eyes and an enthusiastic smile that makes the freedom feel appealing.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="code-road-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.code-road.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={code-road-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="reuse-cost-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. The promising option has a catch, and she is incredulous that so much work must be repeated. On “只能用一次了”, she raises her free index finger with a disbelieving eyebrow lift and gives “一次” pointed stress. The description of copying flows quickly with mounting frustration; “原封不动抄一遍” gets a short head shake. The final “又会” is audibly exasperated, ending with a questioning open palm at the token cost.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="reuse-cost-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.reuse-cost.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={reuse-cost-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="timing-cost-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She insists that the next problem is the one the viewer really needs to understand. On “更要命的是”, she leans slightly forward, narrows her eyes in focused concern and gives the phrase a firm accent. She explains the different words and voice tracks in quick connected phrasing. At “每次” and “重新”, her free hand gives two distinct emphatic beats, finishing the repeated timing work with an incredulous head shake.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="timing-cost-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.timing-cost.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={timing-cost-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="water-break-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. A compact continuous four-second shot: she briefly covers her mouth with her free hand and coughs once, then immediately looks and reaches beyond the right edge of the picture to bring in a sealed-lid straw cup. The cup has a coral-red lid, a white body and a drinking straw. She takes one quick sip, lowers the cup below her mouth, returns her gaze to the lens and smiles warmly as she says the short closing dialogue, “我们继续”. The smile and brisk, upbeat delivery show that she is ready to carry on. Her microphone hand lowers the microphone slightly for the cough and sip, then brings it back toward her mouth for the words; her free hand keeps the cup after the sip. The reach is toward screen-right, the viewer's right. The actions connect immediately, leaving the end of the four seconds for the complete spoken phrase. Include the brief cough and sip sounds with her speech. The camera stays fixed.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="water-break-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Param name="edit-rhythm" value="continuous-take"/>
    <text:Param name="performance" value="reactive-playful"/>
    <text:Param name="gesture" value="natural"/>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.water-break.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={water-break-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="synthesis-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She is delighted to announce the solution after all that frustration. “而 Hypit” arrives with a confident smile and a fresh lift in her voice. On “最值钱的东西都留下了”, she draws her open hand toward herself with a pleased nod. On “最烧钱的东西都扔掉了”, the same hand makes a brisk outward dismissive sweep and the sentence lands decisively. The contrasting gestures follow her conviction about keeping what matters and discarding waste.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="synthesis-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.synthesis.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={synthesis-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="components-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She enjoys explaining a practical shortcut that makes the viewer's work easier. On “只需要写一次”, she lifts her free index finger and gives “一次” a confident, satisfied accent. Her delivery becomes rhythmically nimble through “换文案、换图、换颜色”, with a flowing sequence of open-hand beats. On “一行代码都不用重写了”, she gives a small assured head shake and a delighted smile, landing the promise clearly.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="components-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.components.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={components-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="semantic-time-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She shares the central insight with focused enthusiasm, looking straight at the viewer. “把稿子当做时间线” gets a confident nod. On “不是绑定在秒上”, her free palm turns outward with a brief head shake; on “绑定在说的话上”, it turns toward the viewer as her expression brightens. Stress “秒” and “说的话” through distinct accents and an assured final cadence while keeping the Mandarin tones clear.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="semantic-time-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.semantic-time.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={semantic-time-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="semantic-demo-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She makes the idea tangible with the pleasure of showing that it really works. Give “第一名” a crisp accent accompanied by a small upward hand beat, and the later product name a second distinct beat. She becomes visibly pleased as she explains that the words and voice can change: raised brows, a warm smile, and confident flowing delivery. Finish “一个时间点都不用改了” with a small decisive head shake and a satisfied downward vocal landing.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="semantic-demo-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.semantic-demo.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={semantic-demo-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="result-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She confidently gathers the payoff for the viewer, with energized, persuasive delivery. On “素材生成完就能直接拿到成片”, she opens her free palm forward with a pleased nod. Give “连一秒钟” a pointed, delighted emphasis; then broaden the smile and land “完全一模一样” firmly, keeping the conclusion quick and assured.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="result-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.result.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={result-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="reference-reveal-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She reveals her own example with pleased, slightly mischievous pride. On “这条视频”, she gives a small open-handed gesture toward herself, then looks directly into the lens. As she asks “你们猜得出”, she leans a little closer and lifts her eyebrows with a teasing smile. The final question has a curious, inviting lift, as though she is genuinely waiting for the viewer's guess.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="reference-reveal-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.reference-reveal.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={reference-reveal-action}/>
  </text:Render>

<text:Value id="closing-action">HOST is the woman in @image1, with the Mandarin voice identity of @audio1. Keep the handheld microphone in the same hand and use the free hand for gestures. She realizes she has run long, then quickly turns that embarrassment into an affectionate, lively farewell. From the very first frame, her head is already tilted down and her gaze is on the phone already held in her free hand. She begins “哎呀” while still looking down at that phone, eyebrows lifting in amused surprise. Through “说好一分钟的，怎么超时这么久了”, she lifts her eyes back to the camera and lowers the phone. She immediately returns to the lens with a slightly sheepish grin and gives the search and installation invitation in brisk, friendly Mandarin. “免费领取” and “一百个” carry delighted emphasis with an inviting open palm toward the viewer. On “我们下期见”, her smile broadens; while saying the final “拜拜”, she extends her free hand toward the camera and fully covers the lens just as the words finish. End with the lens covered. The camera itself stays fixed.</text:Value>

<text:Render id="closing-prompt" template={speaker-kit.speaker-v1} recipe={settings.speaker.host}>
    <text:Param name="composition-stability" value="soft-locked"/>
    <text:Set name="dialogue" text={copy.story.segment.closing.dialogue}/>
    <text:Set name="action" text={closing-action}/>
  </text:Render>
</svml>
